<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>This site exists to show what happens to URLs when a site changes. Every page here has been shared somewhere:
  in a newsletter, in a forum thread, in a bookmark folder, in an answer an AI assistant gave to somebody last week.
  When a page moves, all of those links break unless the site keeps a promise it never wrote down. Permalock writes it down.</p>
</Base>
